1
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:30,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Silent Storm]</font>

2
00:02:30,760 --> 00:02:33,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Daode Gate]</font>

3
00:02:41,880 --> 00:02:46,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Daode Gate]</font>

4
00:02:48,160 --> 00:02:50,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 6]</font>

5
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:10,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Eat up, Tianbao.</font>

6
00:03:12,030 --> 00:03:13,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When did you start tailing me?</font>

7
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:14,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao, you've got it wrong.</font>

8
00:03:14,910 --> 00:03:18,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I asked when you started tailing me.</font>

9
00:03:19,750 --> 00:03:20,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao,</font>

10
00:03:21,150 --> 00:03:22,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at the arcade that day,</font>

11
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:24,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you were the one who approached me.</font>

12
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:28,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Play a round for me.</font>

13
00:03:28,710 --> 00:03:31,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What about the cafe? The pool hall?</font>

14
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:33,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You thought I hadn't noticed you?</font>

15
00:03:37,310 --> 00:03:39,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why were you at the warehouse?</font>

16
00:03:55,750 --> 00:03:56,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go, Tianbao.</font>

17
00:03:58,840 --> 00:03:59,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Move!</font>

18
00:04:15,870 --> 00:04:16,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get up!</font>

19
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:30,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go.</font>

20
00:04:59,870 --> 00:05:00,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you a cop?</font>

21
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:01,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

22
00:05:02,390 --> 00:05:03,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then who are you?</font>

23
00:05:14,270 --> 00:05:15,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Three months ago,</font>

24
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:17,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at a factory in Chunjiang,</font>

25
00:05:17,390 --> 00:05:19,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I printed fake invoices for the owner.</font>

26
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:22,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then the police raided the place</font>

27
00:05:23,270 --> 00:05:24,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and arrested us.</font>

28
00:05:24,870 --> 00:05:26,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was sent back to my hometown.</font>

29
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:27,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I got back,</font>

30
00:05:27,390 --> 00:05:28,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wanted to confront my old boss.</font>

31
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:30,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who was your boss?</font>

32
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:32,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Ahong.</font>

33
00:05:34,360 --> 00:05:35,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did she pin it all on you?</font>

34
00:05:35,830 --> 00:05:37,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She wanted to silence all of us.</font>

35
00:05:37,870 --> 00:05:39,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But the police got there first.</font>

36
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:42,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She was after you. Why follow me?</font>

37
00:05:42,430 --> 00:05:44,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I came back to keep an eye on her.</font>

38
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:46,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I saw you.</font>

39
00:05:49,510 --> 00:05:50,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After watching you for a few days,</font>

40
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:52,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I realized, Tianbao,</font>

41
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:54,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that you're a loyal man.</font>

42
00:05:54,950 --> 00:05:56,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">People like us,</font>

43
00:05:56,510 --> 00:05:57,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with no status</font>

44
00:05:57,510 --> 00:05:58,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or connections,</font>

45
00:05:58,750 --> 00:06:01,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">need someone powerful to back us.</font>

46
00:06:02,190 --> 00:06:02,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, Tianbao,</font>

47
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:07,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to work for you.</font>

48
00:06:07,950 --> 00:06:09,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Will you help me get justice?</font>

49
00:06:10,870 --> 00:06:11,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Play a round for me.</font>

50
00:06:12,310 --> 00:06:13,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I... I don't know how.</font>

51
00:06:19,750 --> 00:06:21,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just pick one and press start.</font>

52
00:06:46,270 --> 00:06:46,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's yours.</font>

53
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:48,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've got a lucky touch.</font>

54
00:06:59,120 --> 00:07:00,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cook it for me first.</font>

55
00:07:00,560 --> 00:07:01,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

56
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:02,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait a second, Master.</font>

57
00:07:02,120 --> 00:07:03,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here are the chopsticks.</font>

58
00:07:03,310 --> 00:07:04,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine. Try it.</font>

59
00:07:04,920 --> 00:07:05,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I hate to say it,</font>

60
00:07:06,720 --> 00:07:07,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but you're so stubborn.</font>

61
00:07:08,190 --> 00:07:10,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The doctor said
you could leave tomorrow,</font>

62
00:07:10,190 --> 00:07:11,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but you insisted on today.</font>

63
00:07:11,390 --> 00:07:13,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The hospital food is tasteless.</font>

64
00:07:13,630 --> 00:07:15,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I couldn't stand another day there.</font>

65
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:16,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master,</font>

66
00:07:16,630 --> 00:07:17,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if Linlin asks about it,</font>

67
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:18,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">don't let anything slip.</font>

68
00:07:18,830 --> 00:07:20,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It wasn't easy keeping this from her.</font>

69
00:07:20,870 --> 00:07:21,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

70
00:07:22,870 --> 00:07:23,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master,</font>

71
00:07:24,630 --> 00:07:25,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when you got stabbed,</font>

72
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:28,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it hurt worse than being stabbed myself.</font>

73
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:29,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're the only family I have.</font>

74
00:07:30,270 --> 00:07:31,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If anything happened to you,</font>

75
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:33,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how could I go on?</font>

76
00:07:37,040 --> 00:07:38,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well, when you put it like that,</font>

77
00:07:39,190 --> 00:07:41,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I suppose you do have a heart, kid.</font>

78
00:07:44,190 --> 00:07:46,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're less than two years
from retirement.</font>

79
00:07:47,120 --> 00:07:48,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why not take this opportunity</font>

80
00:07:48,430 --> 00:07:50,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to retire early?</font>

81
00:07:51,120 --> 00:07:52,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll look after you.</font>

82
00:07:53,160 --> 00:07:53,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you mean?</font>

83
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:55,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You want me to retire?</font>

84
00:07:55,360 --> 00:07:56,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Like those old men,</font>

85
00:07:56,920 --> 00:07:58,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">spending all day
playing chess and cards?</font>

86
00:07:59,510 --> 00:08:01,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd rather get stabbed again.</font>

87
00:08:01,720 --> 00:08:02,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master,</font>

88
00:08:02,390 --> 00:08:03,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">don't talk like that.</font>

89
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:04,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When you got stabbed,</font>

90
00:08:04,830 --> 00:08:06,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you scared us both half to death.</font>

91
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:07,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen,</font>

92
00:08:07,390 --> 00:08:09,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm serious about this.</font>

93
00:08:11,510 --> 00:08:14,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Haichao Factory case isn't over.</font>

94
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:15,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What if someone comes after you again?</font>

95
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:16,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What then?</font>

96
00:08:17,120 --> 00:08:18,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And Ping'an</font>

97
00:08:18,070 --> 00:08:19,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">visited you in hospital several times,</font>

98
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:20,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">asking what had happened,</font>

99
00:08:20,800 --> 00:08:22,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but you barely said a word.</font>

100
00:08:22,160 --> 00:08:22,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enough.</font>

101
00:08:22,950 --> 00:08:24,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You never stop going on about it.</font>

102
00:08:25,600 --> 00:08:26,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Over the years,</font>

103
00:08:26,120 --> 00:08:27,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've faced plenty of trouble.</font>

104
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:29,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Worry about yourself.</font>

105
00:08:29,830 --> 00:08:31,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you heard about
your tax school training?</font>

106
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:33,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't change the subject.</font>

107
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:35,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Besides, I don't want
to climb the ranks.</font>

108
00:08:35,440 --> 00:08:36,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Send Zhou instead.</font>

109
00:08:36,550 --> 00:08:37,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't sit still, anyway.</font>

110
00:08:38,600 --> 00:08:40,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's exactly why you should go.</font>

111
00:08:40,870 --> 00:08:42,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We work in tax.</font>

112
00:08:42,750 --> 00:08:44,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're not detectives
charging into danger.</font>

113
00:08:44,870 --> 00:08:46,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The training will help you</font>

114
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:48,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">build a stronger academic foundation.</font>

115
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:51,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It'll give you more options
in the future.</font>

116
00:08:51,670 --> 00:08:53,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, he's right.</font>

117
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:55,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ouyang, he's only
just left the hospital.</font>

118
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:56,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen to him.</font>

119
00:08:56,630 --> 00:08:58,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's the one who won't listen.</font>

120
00:08:58,600 --> 00:09:00,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then maybe you're my master.</font>

121
00:09:00,270 --> 00:09:00,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

122
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:01,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master.</font>

123
00:09:02,240 --> 00:09:03,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're asking for this.</font>

124
00:09:04,030 --> 00:09:05,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Master.
- Are you all right?</font>

125
00:09:05,390 --> 00:09:06,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You little brat.</font>

126
00:09:06,790 --> 00:09:07,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, I'm fine.</font>

127
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:08,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Careful.
- Your wound.</font>

128
00:09:08,550 --> 00:09:09,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All right, all right.</font>

129
00:09:09,120 --> 00:09:10,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's eat.</font>

130
00:09:10,630 --> 00:09:12,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, eat first.</font>

131
00:09:13,030 --> 00:09:14,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, I know what you're thinking.</font>

132
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:16,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're trying to get me to retire.</font>

133
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:19,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who'll keep you in line when I'm gone?</font>

134
00:09:19,790 --> 00:09:20,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks. Here.</font>

135
00:09:21,150 --> 00:09:21,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's hot.</font>

136
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:23,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All right, let's eat.</font>

137
00:09:23,270 --> 00:09:24,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All right, all right.</font>

138
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:26,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today's meeting is important.</font>

139
00:09:27,320 --> 00:09:27,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here you are.</font>

140
00:09:28,150 --> 00:09:28,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Director Ye.</font>

141
00:09:29,150 --> 00:09:29,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sit down.</font>

142
00:09:29,630 --> 00:09:30,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How's your wound?</font>

143
00:09:32,120 --> 00:09:34,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's healing much more
slowly these days.</font>

144
00:09:35,150 --> 00:09:36,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I used to be back on my feet</font>

145
00:09:36,870 --> 00:09:38,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in two or three days.</font>

146
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:41,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have they caught your attacker?</font>

147
00:09:41,480 --> 00:09:42,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry.</font>

148
00:09:42,550 --> 00:09:43,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's only a matter of time.</font>

149
00:09:43,870 --> 00:09:44,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He can't get away.</font>

150
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:45,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone's here.</font>

151
00:09:48,550 --> 00:09:49,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All right, let's begin.</font>

152
00:09:51,790 --> 00:09:52,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come here.</font>

153
00:09:52,200 --> 00:09:52,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, Zhang.</font>

154
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:53,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Sit down.
- Sit here.</font>

155
00:09:54,440 --> 00:09:56,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've called in the heads
of every district,</font>

156
00:09:56,720 --> 00:09:58,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">county and department today.</font>

157
00:09:59,120 --> 00:10:00,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">None of the junior staff.</font>

158
00:10:00,670 --> 00:10:01,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not one of you</font>

159
00:10:02,030 --> 00:10:03,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has kept your word.</font>

160
00:10:03,630 --> 00:10:05,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you trying to walk all over me?</font>

161
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:07,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I gave you two weeks at our last meeting</font>

162
00:10:07,320 --> 00:10:09,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to submit staff lists
for the state and local tax split.</font>

163
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:11,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I gave you another two weeks,</font>

164
00:10:11,270 --> 00:10:12,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and not one list has come in.</font>

165
00:10:12,630 --> 00:10:14,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell me why.</font>

166
00:10:15,480 --> 00:10:16,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Director Zhao,</font>

167
00:10:16,390 --> 00:10:18,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the local staff have serious concerns.</font>

168
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:20,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They say the tax split</font>

169
00:10:21,080 --> 00:10:23,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">leaves the easy-to-collect
taxes to the state bureau</font>

170
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:25,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the difficult ones
to the local bureau.</font>

171
00:10:26,080 --> 00:10:28,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All they get is abuse and dirty looks.</font>

172
00:10:28,720 --> 00:10:30,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A few easy years,</font>

173
00:10:30,120 --> 00:10:31,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and they've gone soft?</font>

174
00:10:31,600 --> 00:10:32,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We used to go door to door,</font>

175
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:34,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">collecting taxes, bags in hand.</font>

176
00:10:34,670 --> 00:10:35,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We got through it, didn't we?</font>

177
00:10:35,790 --> 00:10:36,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Director Zhao,</font>

178
00:10:36,510 --> 00:10:37,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">young people these days</font>

179
00:10:37,600 --> 00:10:39,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">aren't like we were.</font>

180
00:10:39,630 --> 00:10:41,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Asking them to work from dawn till dusk,</font>

181
00:10:41,630 --> 00:10:43,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">collecting taxes in all weathers,</font>

182
00:10:43,670 --> 00:10:45,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is asking a lot.</font>

183
00:10:45,150 --> 00:10:47,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Local tax collectors
are bound to upset people.</font>

184
00:10:47,910 --> 00:10:49,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone has their difficulties.</font>

185
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:51,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Money, skills, connections...</font>

186
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:52,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's be honest.</font>

187
00:10:52,960 --> 00:10:53,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're afraid of change.</font>

188
00:10:54,750 --> 00:10:56,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They've had secure jobs here</font>

189
00:10:56,670 --> 00:10:58,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for so long, they've grown comfortable.</font>

190
00:10:58,320 --> 00:11:00,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Moving somewhere new
feels like a hassle.</font>

191
00:11:01,030 --> 00:11:02,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But, comrades,</font>

192
00:11:02,120 --> 00:11:03,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from central planning
to reform and opening up,</font>

193
00:11:04,320 --> 00:11:06,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">progress and development
depend on change.</font>

194
00:11:06,720 --> 00:11:07,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stand still, you fall behind.</font>

195
00:11:07,960 --> 00:11:08,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Change</font>

196
00:11:08,870 --> 00:11:10,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is what defines our times.</font>

197
00:11:10,960 --> 00:11:13,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Splitting the tax system
is bound to be hard,</font>

198
00:11:13,320 --> 00:11:14,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but if</font>

199
00:11:14,270 --> 00:11:15,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we lack even the courage to change,</font>

200
00:11:16,200 --> 00:11:18,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the times may leave us behind.</font>

201
00:11:19,030 --> 00:11:20,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course I want the state tax bureau.</font>

202
00:11:20,790 --> 00:11:21,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's the national team.</font>

203
00:11:21,790 --> 00:11:23,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I'm demoted to the local bureau,</font>

204
00:11:23,200 --> 00:11:24,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who knows</font>

205
00:11:24,360 --> 00:11:25,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what'll happen to me?</font>

206
00:11:25,630 --> 00:11:27,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your uncle works
for the provincial government, right?</font>

207
00:11:27,750 --> 00:11:28,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pull some strings for me.</font>

208
00:11:29,870 --> 00:11:31,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jia Shijie,</font>

209
00:11:31,080 --> 00:11:32,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you've been on the phone
for half an hour.</font>

210
00:11:32,960 --> 00:11:33,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you give it a rest?</font>

211
00:11:34,360 --> 00:11:35,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're blocking the work calls.</font>

212
00:11:35,600 --> 00:11:36,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please,</font>

213
00:11:38,360 --> 00:11:39,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">put in a good word for me.</font>

214
00:11:40,320 --> 00:11:40,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got it.</font>

215
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:43,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Zhou,</font>

216
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:46,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">look at the time.</font>

217
00:11:46,030 --> 00:11:47,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're still buried in work.</font>

218
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:49,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't know your next post.</font>

219
00:11:49,960 --> 00:11:50,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who are you working for?</font>

220
00:11:51,030 --> 00:11:53,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm telling you,</font>

221
00:11:53,480 --> 00:11:55,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you can't just keep your head down.</font>

222
00:11:56,120 --> 00:11:57,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look up and see where you're going.</font>

223
00:11:58,000 --> 00:12:00,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There are four of us on this team.</font>

224
00:12:00,600 --> 00:12:01,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Given the quota</font>

225
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:02,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for the local tax bureau,</font>

226
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:04,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at least one of us has to go.</font>

227
00:12:05,270 --> 00:12:06,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ouyang doesn't count.</font>

228
00:12:06,550 --> 00:12:07,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhang sent him</font>

229
00:12:07,440 --> 00:12:08,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to the tax school.</font>

230
00:12:09,200 --> 00:12:10,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's on the fast track.</font>

231
00:12:10,670 --> 00:12:11,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, give me a break.</font>

232
00:12:11,870 --> 00:12:13,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's just bad at his job.</font>

233
00:12:13,360 --> 00:12:14,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's why he's in training.</font>

234
00:12:14,790 --> 00:12:15,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm bad at my job, too.</font>

235
00:12:16,440 --> 00:12:17,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why didn't they send me?</font>

236
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:18,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just take things as they come.</font>

237
00:12:19,550 --> 00:12:20,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But, Wang Zhou,</font>

238
00:12:20,670 --> 00:12:22,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I hate to admit it,</font>

239
00:12:22,320 --> 00:12:24,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you do the work of three people.</font>

240
00:12:24,360 --> 00:12:26,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhang won't let you go for that.</font>

241
00:12:26,150 --> 00:12:27,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're safe.</font>

242
00:12:31,750 --> 00:12:32,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yawen,</font>

243
00:12:34,720 --> 00:12:37,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">one of us will be the lucky winner.</font>

244
00:12:37,600 --> 00:12:38,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, tell me.</font>

245
00:12:38,630 --> 00:12:39,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you think?</font>

246
00:12:40,670 --> 00:12:42,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Me? I don't really mind.</font>

247
00:12:43,510 --> 00:12:45,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I hear the local bureau funds itself.</font>

248
00:12:46,320 --> 00:12:47,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Their cafeteria
must be better than ours.</font>

249
00:12:49,120 --> 00:12:50,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So the local bureau's perfect for you.</font>

250
00:12:51,000 --> 00:12:51,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then you can</font>

251
00:12:51,720 --> 00:12:54,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">find a nice man in the civil service,</font>

252
00:12:54,630 --> 00:12:55,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">get married, and be set for life.</font>

253
00:12:56,360 --> 00:12:58,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wouldn't have to worry about you.</font>

254
00:12:58,840 --> 00:13:00,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you get tired of talking?</font>

255
00:13:00,720 --> 00:13:01,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have one.</font>

256
00:13:01,600 --> 00:13:02,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, thanks.</font>

257
00:13:02,720 --> 00:13:03,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Actually, I'd still worry.</font>

258
00:13:04,030 --> 00:13:05,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whoever you end up with,</font>

259
00:13:05,270 --> 00:13:06,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">bring him to meet me.</font>

260
00:13:06,080 --> 00:13:07,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll give him the once-over.</font>

261
00:13:07,600 --> 00:13:08,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get lost.</font>

262
00:13:08,120 --> 00:13:09,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who are you referring to?</font>

263
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:11,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You and your big talk.</font>

264
00:13:11,550 --> 00:13:12,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

265
00:13:14,120 --> 00:13:14,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yawen,</font>

266
00:13:15,480 --> 00:13:16,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you're eating again?</font>

267
00:13:17,080 --> 00:13:17,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How many meals have you had?</font>

268
00:13:19,150 --> 00:13:20,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I... I skipped breakfast.</font>

269
00:13:20,790 --> 00:13:21,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm making up for it.</font>

270
00:13:22,240 --> 00:13:23,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You haven't eaten? Then eat up.</font>

271
00:13:23,510 --> 00:13:24,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need to hide it.</font>

272
00:13:24,510 --> 00:13:25,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry up and eat.</font>

273
00:13:27,960 --> 00:13:28,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come back.</font>

274
00:13:36,720 --> 00:13:37,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master.</font>

275
00:13:37,910 --> 00:13:38,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why aren't you in class?</font>

276
00:13:40,030 --> 00:13:40,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master,</font>

277
00:13:41,030 --> 00:13:42,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just busted an invoice resale racket.</font>

278
00:13:42,630 --> 00:13:44,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You skipped class, didn't you?</font>

279
00:13:44,510 --> 00:13:46,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You learn by doing.</font>

280
00:13:46,630 --> 00:13:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Class is so boring.</font>

281
00:13:48,550 --> 00:13:50,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine. I'll give you a little push.</font>

282
00:13:52,600 --> 00:13:53,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, I'll go.</font>

283
00:13:53,390 --> 00:13:54,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry to class!</font>

284
00:13:55,400 --> 00:13:57,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Linhai Provincial Tax College]</font>

285
00:14:06,720 --> 00:14:07,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There you are, Ouyang Xu.</font>

286
00:14:08,440 --> 00:14:09,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know what we are discussing?</font>

287
00:14:10,120 --> 00:14:11,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The window tax.</font>

288
00:14:11,910 --> 00:14:12,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The window tax.</font>

289
00:14:13,240 --> 00:14:13,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good.</font>

290
00:14:14,440 --> 00:14:15,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come explain it to the class.</font>

291
00:14:15,750 --> 00:14:16,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is the window tax?</font>

292
00:14:17,150 --> 00:14:18,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure. May I come up to the front?</font>

293
00:14:19,030 --> 00:14:19,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please do.</font>

294
00:14:20,320 --> 00:14:21,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Very good, Ouyang Xu.</font>

295
00:14:26,270 --> 00:14:27,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The window tax</font>

296
00:14:27,480 --> 00:14:29,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">originated in England
in the late 17th century.</font>

297
00:14:30,120 --> 00:14:31,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The British government</font>

298
00:14:31,510 --> 00:14:32,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">counted a house's windows</font>

299
00:14:33,150 --> 00:14:34,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to assess its level of luxury.</font>

300
00:14:35,440 --> 00:14:37,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Each window was taxed.</font>

301
00:14:37,790 --> 00:14:39,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So people started building houses</font>

302
00:14:39,360 --> 00:14:41,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">without windows.</font>

303
00:14:42,120 --> 00:14:43,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Many existing windows</font>

304
00:14:43,960 --> 00:14:45,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">were boarded up as well</font>

305
00:14:45,550 --> 00:14:47,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to avoid the tax.</font>

306
00:14:47,670 --> 00:14:49,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Over the decades,</font>

307
00:14:49,440 --> 00:14:51,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this seriously reduced ventilation</font>

308
00:14:51,870 --> 00:14:53,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in people's homes</font>

309
00:14:53,510 --> 00:14:55,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and caused serious harm</font>

310
00:14:55,440 --> 00:14:56,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to their health.</font>

311
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:58,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So this tax</font>

312
00:14:58,630 --> 00:15:00,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was abolished in</font>

313
00:15:00,670 --> 00:15:01,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the mid-19th century.</font>

314
00:15:02,120 --> 00:15:04,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think taxes on chimneys and windows</font>

315
00:15:04,750 --> 00:15:05,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">went against</font>

316
00:15:06,150 --> 00:15:07,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the very purpose of taxation</font>

317
00:15:07,510 --> 00:15:09,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to improve people's lives.</font>

318
00:15:09,630 --> 00:15:11,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They show us what not to do.</font>

319
00:15:11,550 --> 00:15:13,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These taxes were imposed</font>

320
00:15:13,720 --> 00:15:14,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in a crude, heavy-handed way.</font>

321
00:15:14,790 --> 00:15:16,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They were tools of class oppression.</font>

322
00:15:16,480 --> 00:15:17,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These unjust taxes</font>

323
00:15:18,080 --> 00:15:19,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">caused terrible hardship,</font>

324
00:15:19,720 --> 00:15:20,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">especially for the poor.</font>

325
00:15:21,080 --> 00:15:22,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They became an unbearable burden.</font>

326
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:24,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">China's tax system</font>

327
00:15:25,390 --> 00:15:27,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">must learn from that</font>

328
00:15:27,910 --> 00:15:29,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from legislation to enforcement.</font>

329
00:15:29,240 --> 00:15:31,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Only through fairness and justice</font>

330
00:15:31,200 --> 00:15:32,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can we serve the people.</font>

331
00:15:33,030 --> 00:15:35,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tax law should put people first</font>

332
00:15:35,480 --> 00:15:37,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and reflect society's compassion.</font>

333
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:38,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That requires</font>

334
00:15:38,840 --> 00:15:40,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">everyone working in taxation</font>

335
00:15:40,480 --> 00:15:42,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to do their part.</font>

336
00:15:51,840 --> 00:15:52,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Tang.</font>

337
00:15:54,080 --> 00:15:54,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello, Ms. Tang.</font>

338
00:15:56,360 --> 00:15:57,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've come to apologize.</font>

339
00:15:58,000 --> 00:15:58,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I shouldn't have been late.</font>

340
00:16:02,840 --> 00:16:03,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ouyang Xu,</font>

341
00:16:06,120 --> 00:16:07,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">do you know what respect means?</font>

342
00:16:09,510 --> 00:16:10,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Respect other people,</font>

343
00:16:10,960 --> 00:16:11,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">respect knowledge,</font>

344
00:16:12,360 --> 00:16:14,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and respect your profession.</font>

345
00:16:14,960 --> 00:16:16,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That starts with basic courtesy.</font>

346
00:16:17,320 --> 00:16:19,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you're late again,</font>

347
00:16:19,600 --> 00:16:20,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">ask permission to enter</font>

348
00:16:21,440 --> 00:16:22,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and bow before coming in.</font>

349
00:16:23,390 --> 00:16:24,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got it?</font>

350
00:16:25,270 --> 00:16:25,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got it.</font>

351
00:16:30,480 --> 00:16:31,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll give you another chance.</font>

352
00:16:32,480 --> 00:16:34,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you're serious about apologizing,</font>

353
00:16:34,440 --> 00:16:35,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">tell us next time</font>

354
00:16:35,840 --> 00:16:37,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how you heroically raided</font>

355
00:16:37,240 --> 00:16:38,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that counterfeit factory.</font>

356
00:16:38,240 --> 00:16:39,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can tell you now.</font>

357
00:16:40,600 --> 00:16:41,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well, I don't have time now.</font>

358
00:16:41,870 --> 00:16:42,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm off duty.</font>

359
00:16:56,120 --> 00:16:58,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At around 11:30 PM on July 7,</font>

360
00:16:58,440 --> 00:17:00,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">villagers in Dawei,
northeast of the city,</font>

361
00:17:00,320 --> 00:17:01,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">heard gunshots.</font>

362
00:17:01,550 --> 00:17:03,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was reported at 11:37 PM.</font>

363
00:17:03,790 --> 00:17:06,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The scene was an abandoned warehouse,</font>

364
00:17:06,310 --> 00:17:07,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">suspected of being a smuggling depot.</font>

365
00:17:08,640 --> 00:17:11,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We found six restricted knives</font>

366
00:17:11,240 --> 00:17:12,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and smashed bottles of Martell.</font>

367
00:17:13,160 --> 00:17:14,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Some of the liquor had
already been removed.</font>

368
00:17:14,960 --> 00:17:16,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All four bodies found at the scene</font>

369
00:17:16,350 --> 00:17:17,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">had snake tattoos.</font>

370
00:17:18,070 --> 00:17:20,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Background checks revealed</font>

371
00:17:20,510 --> 00:17:22,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that all four were gang members
in Hong Kong, China.</font>

372
00:17:22,880 --> 00:17:23,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As the handover approaches,</font>

373
00:17:24,200 --> 00:17:25,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">these gangs</font>

374
00:17:25,270 --> 00:17:26,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are eyeing mainland business.</font>

375
00:17:26,680 --> 00:17:28,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This was most likely</font>

376
00:17:28,510 --> 00:17:30,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a shootout over smuggling territory.</font>

377
00:17:31,000 --> 00:17:33,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This U.S. military bayonet
was found there.</font>

378
00:17:33,720 --> 00:17:34,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our comparison shows</font>

379
00:17:34,880 --> 00:17:36,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that it closely resembles</font>

380
00:17:36,110 --> 00:17:39,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the weapon used to stab
Captain Zhang Haiyuan</font>

381
00:17:39,070 --> 00:17:39,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">two months ago.</font>

382
00:17:40,070 --> 00:17:42,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We assessed the wound's width and depth,</font>

383
00:17:42,750 --> 00:17:44,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the shape of the blade.</font>

384
00:17:44,960 --> 00:17:47,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We first thought
the attack was retaliation</font>

385
00:17:47,200 --> 00:17:48,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">over the fake invoice case.</font>

386
00:17:48,640 --> 00:17:50,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now it seems there's more to it.</font>

387
00:17:51,110 --> 00:17:52,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There may well have been</font>

388
00:17:52,110 --> 00:17:54,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chinese Hong Kong gang involvement.</font>

389
00:17:55,030 --> 00:17:58,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One victim had two gunshot wounds.</font>

390
00:17:58,440 --> 00:18:00,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ballistics showed that both bullets</font>

391
00:18:00,920 --> 00:18:03,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">came from the same Type 54 pistol.</font>

392
00:18:03,590 --> 00:18:05,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But no gun was found at the scene.</font>

393
00:18:06,960 --> 00:18:08,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here is a trail of bloody footprints.</font>

394
00:18:08,790 --> 00:18:09,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're very close together.</font>

395
00:18:13,350 --> 00:18:15,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The trail ends
at the warehouse's back door.</font>

396
00:18:16,640 --> 00:18:18,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These are car tire tracks.</font>

397
00:18:18,960 --> 00:18:20,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The two suspects
probably escaped by car.</font>

398
00:18:21,200 --> 00:18:23,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A severed thumb was found at the scene.</font>

399
00:18:23,680 --> 00:18:25,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We don't yet know if it
belongs to either suspect.</font>

400
00:18:26,110 --> 00:18:26,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That concludes the report.</font>

401
00:18:27,110 --> 00:18:29,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Any leads on those two suspects</font>

402
00:18:29,680 --> 00:18:30,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the car?</font>

403
00:18:30,640 --> 00:18:31,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As for the car,</font>

404
00:18:31,240 --> 00:18:33,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we're investigating
with the traffic police.</font>

405
00:18:33,920 --> 00:18:35,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've also alerted the major hospitals.</font>

406
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:38,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If anyone comes in with a missing thumb,</font>

407
00:18:38,240 --> 00:18:39,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they'll notify us at once.</font>

408
00:18:40,400 --> 00:18:42,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You did well on</font>

409
00:18:43,000 --> 00:18:44,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Haichao Factory case.</font>

410
00:18:44,350 --> 00:18:45,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're one of our key officers now.</font>

411
00:18:46,200 --> 00:18:47,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And what makes a key officer?</font>

412
00:18:48,200 --> 00:18:49,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Solving cases.</font>

413
00:18:50,000 --> 00:18:50,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief Luo.</font>

414
00:18:50,680 --> 00:18:51,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

415
00:18:51,790 --> 00:18:52,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me a deadline.</font>

416
00:18:53,110 --> 00:18:54,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How long to solve it?</font>

417
00:19:00,550 --> 00:19:01,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Within one month.</font>

418
00:19:01,160 --> 00:19:01,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How long exactly?</font>

419
00:19:04,720 --> 00:19:05,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Over two weeks. Less than a month.</font>

420
00:19:06,200 --> 00:19:07,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'd better meet that deadline.</font>

421
00:19:07,680 --> 00:19:08,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

422
00:19:12,840 --> 00:19:17,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Aike Trading Co., Ltd.]</font>

423
00:19:17,880 --> 00:19:18,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ouyang.</font>

424
00:19:19,030 --> 00:19:19,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What took you so long?</font>

425
00:19:20,110 --> 00:19:20,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was him.</font>

426
00:19:21,510 --> 00:19:22,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It is a long way here.</font>

427
00:19:22,960 --> 00:19:23,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go over what we know.</font>

428
00:19:23,960 --> 00:19:25,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yan Ping'an and the police</font>

429
00:19:25,590 --> 00:19:26,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">worked with the industry
and commerce bureau</font>

430
00:19:26,790 --> 00:19:27,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to seize the smuggled liquor.</font>

431
00:19:28,350 --> 00:19:30,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Aike Trading issued the invoices.</font>

432
00:19:30,640 --> 00:19:31,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Customs will investigate</font>

433
00:19:31,680 --> 00:19:32,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the smuggling itself.</font>

434
00:19:32,720 --> 00:19:34,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But invoicing smuggled goods</font>

435
00:19:34,310 --> 00:19:36,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is criminal speculation
and profiteering.</font>

436
00:19:36,350 --> 00:19:37,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At the very least,</font>

437
00:19:37,110 --> 00:19:39,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's aiding tax evasion.</font>

438
00:19:40,000 --> 00:19:41,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you know what to check inside?</font>

439
00:19:42,510 --> 00:19:43,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The usual procedure, then.</font>

440
00:19:43,680 --> 00:19:44,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Check the ledgers first.</font>

441
00:19:44,400 --> 00:19:46,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What if they've cooked the ledgers?</font>

442
00:19:46,270 --> 00:19:47,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then we go back to the office</font>

443
00:19:47,240 --> 00:19:48,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and check each deduction slip.</font>

444
00:19:48,640 --> 00:19:49,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So what?</font>

445
00:19:50,830 --> 00:19:52,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My eyes are worn out.</font>

446
00:19:52,440 --> 00:19:53,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll have to rely on our skills.</font>

447
00:19:53,720 --> 00:19:55,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stay sharp in there.</font>

448
00:19:56,030 --> 00:19:56,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

449
00:19:59,400 --> 00:20:00,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Impressive.</font>

450
00:20:02,310 --> 00:20:03,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Officers.</font>

451
00:20:03,880 --> 00:20:04,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry, sorry.</font>

452
00:20:04,750 --> 00:20:05,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry to keep you waiting.</font>

453
00:20:05,590 --> 00:20:06,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm the manager here.</font>

454
00:20:06,440 --> 00:20:07,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My name's Zhang.</font>

455
00:20:07,240 --> 00:20:09,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can I help you?</font>

456
00:20:09,240 --> 00:20:10,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please sit. Make some tea.</font>

457
00:20:10,790 --> 00:20:12,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need for the trouble.</font>

458
00:20:14,160 --> 00:20:14,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're not here for tea.</font>

459
00:20:15,550 --> 00:20:16,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's a tax inspection.</font>

460
00:20:16,520 --> 00:20:17,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Tax Inspection Certificate]</font>

461
00:20:22,680 --> 00:20:23,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here's the inspection notice.</font>

462
00:20:24,000 --> 00:20:24,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your company's suspected of</font>

463
00:20:24,920 --> 00:20:26,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">invoicing smuggled goods.</font>

464
00:20:26,200 --> 00:20:27,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're here to look into it.</font>

465
00:20:28,880 --> 00:20:30,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There must be some mistake.</font>

466
00:20:30,440 --> 00:20:30,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All our goods</font>

467
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:32,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">come through legitimate channels.</font>

468
00:20:32,960 --> 00:20:34,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And our invoices are genuine and lawful.</font>

469
00:20:37,310 --> 00:20:38,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dajiang Bar's invoice.</font>

470
00:20:38,720 --> 00:20:39,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You issued it, didn't you?</font>

471
00:20:43,590 --> 00:20:45,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Zhang, please have
your accounts staff</font>

472
00:20:46,110 --> 00:20:47,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">bring us the company ledgers</font>

473
00:20:48,030 --> 00:20:49,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for inspection.</font>

474
00:20:49,270 --> 00:20:50,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our accountant's out.</font>

475
00:20:50,510 --> 00:20:51,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I don't have the key</font>

476
00:20:51,480 --> 00:20:52,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to the accounts office.</font>

477
00:20:53,720 --> 00:20:54,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I knew you'd say that.</font>

478
00:20:57,270 --> 00:20:59,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When will the accountant be back?</font>

479
00:21:00,480 --> 00:21:01,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can wait.</font>

480
00:21:03,920 --> 00:21:05,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If the accountant's out,</font>

481
00:21:05,030 --> 00:21:06,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and we can't see the ledgers,</font>

482
00:21:06,640 --> 00:21:08,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we'll check your stock
and purchase orders.</font>

483
00:21:09,440 --> 00:21:10,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You mainly sell alcohol.</font>

484
00:21:11,000 --> 00:21:12,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can show us
the warehouse, can't you?</font>

485
00:21:25,160 --> 00:21:25,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Zhang,</font>

486
00:21:25,920 --> 00:21:27,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this isn't a warehouse, is it?</font>

487
00:21:28,640 --> 00:21:30,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's my boss's private wine cellar.</font>

488
00:21:30,480 --> 00:21:32,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These are all premium imports.</font>

489
00:21:32,400 --> 00:21:33,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you like anything,</font>

490
00:21:33,720 --> 00:21:35,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can send some to your homes.</font>

491
00:21:36,350 --> 00:21:37,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's too expensive for us.</font>

492
00:21:39,440 --> 00:21:40,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't be so formal.</font>

493
00:21:40,790 --> 00:21:41,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's a gift.</font>

494
00:21:42,200 --> 00:21:43,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get the officers' addresses.</font>

495
00:21:44,350 --> 00:21:44,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone,</font>

496
00:21:45,070 --> 00:21:46,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the tea's ready.</font>

497
00:21:46,070 --> 00:21:48,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why don't we sit in the office?</font>

498
00:21:48,240 --> 00:21:49,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's chilly in here.</font>

499
00:21:49,400 --> 00:21:50,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't want you to catch a cold.</font>

500
00:22:00,590 --> 00:22:02,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why is there a safe in the wine cellar?</font>

501
00:22:04,640 --> 00:22:06,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The accounts staff
put it here temporarily</font>

502
00:22:06,350 --> 00:22:07,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to store some working capital.</font>

503
00:22:07,880 --> 00:22:08,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you open it?</font>

504
00:22:08,590 --> 00:22:09,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To be honest,</font>

505
00:22:09,790 --> 00:22:12,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there's cash inside.</font>

506
00:22:12,400 --> 00:22:13,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If we open it,</font>

507
00:22:13,590 --> 00:22:15,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the boss finds a discrepancy later,</font>

508
00:22:15,070 --> 00:22:16,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we'll have to answer for it.</font>

509
00:22:16,400 --> 00:22:17,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry about that.</font>

510
00:22:17,400 --> 00:22:18,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We won't touch anything</font>

511
00:22:18,880 --> 00:22:19,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">unrelated to the inspection.</font>

512
00:22:19,880 --> 00:22:20,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You open it.</font>

513
00:22:20,880 --> 00:22:21,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll just watch.</font>

514
00:22:23,030 --> 00:22:25,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me check if I can open it.</font>

515
00:22:25,790 --> 00:22:26,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please wait a moment.</font>

516
00:22:26,590 --> 00:22:27,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you. Sorry for the trouble.</font>

517
00:22:32,200 --> 00:22:34,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A safe here is a bit odd.</font>

518
00:22:35,510 --> 00:22:36,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

519
00:22:39,550 --> 00:22:41,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're unlawfully detaining us!</font>

520
00:22:41,030 --> 00:22:41,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're calling the police!</font>

521
00:22:42,110 --> 00:22:43,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Unlawfully detaining you?</font>

522
00:22:44,110 --> 00:22:45,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're the ones demanding bribes!</font>

523
00:22:45,550 --> 00:22:47,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You want both the goods and the money.</font>

524
00:22:47,160 --> 00:22:48,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I should call the police!</font>

525
00:22:48,790 --> 00:22:50,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you talking about?</font>

526
00:22:50,640 --> 00:22:51,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Open this door!</font>

527
00:22:51,790 --> 00:22:53,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Turn the cellar down to minimum.</font>

528
00:22:53,680 --> 00:22:54,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Let them cool off.
- Open up!</font>

529
00:22:54,830 --> 00:22:55,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Understood.</font>

530
00:22:57,550 --> 00:22:58,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're gone.</font>

531
00:22:58,550 --> 00:22:59,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do we do now?</font>

532
00:23:02,880 --> 00:23:03,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't panic.</font>

533
00:23:04,240 --> 00:23:05,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They won't dare keep us here long.</font>

534
00:23:07,110 --> 00:23:08,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, this...</font>

535
00:23:14,110 --> 00:23:14,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here's what we'll do.</font>

536
00:23:15,000 --> 00:23:15,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's see if we can find</font>

537
00:23:15,920 --> 00:23:17,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">where they've hidden the ledgers.</font>

538
00:23:17,440 --> 00:23:18,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then check the liquor.</font>

539
00:23:18,830 --> 00:23:20,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Note the prices, places of origin</font>

540
00:23:20,830 --> 00:23:22,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and brands.</font>

541
00:23:22,270 --> 00:23:22,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

542
00:23:22,880 --> 00:23:23,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

543
00:23:23,510 --> 00:23:24,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The ledgers. Where are the ledgers?</font>

544
00:23:24,720 --> 00:23:25,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Be careful.</font>

545
00:23:43,000 --> 00:23:43,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're looking for the ledgers.</font>

546
00:23:43,720 --> 00:23:44,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They must be in there.</font>

547
00:23:44,960 --> 00:23:45,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We have no search warrant.</font>

548
00:23:46,240 --> 00:23:46,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you open it,</font>

549
00:23:46,830 --> 00:23:47,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">won't we be taking the bait?</font>

550
00:23:50,750 --> 00:23:52,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why is the air getting colder?</font>

551
00:23:52,640 --> 00:23:53,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you guys cold, too?</font>

552
00:23:54,310 --> 00:23:55,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It is a bit cold.</font>

553
00:23:55,830 --> 00:23:56,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you squeezing me?</font>

554
00:23:57,240 --> 00:23:58,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm freezing.</font>

555
00:23:58,440 --> 00:23:59,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Crouch down.</font>

556
00:24:09,110 --> 00:24:10,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They came to inspect,</font>

557
00:24:10,200 --> 00:24:11,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but they were after bribes.</font>

558
00:24:11,310 --> 00:24:12,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They want both money and goods.</font>

559
00:24:12,680 --> 00:24:13,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's outrageous, you know.</font>

560
00:24:14,200 --> 00:24:14,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Officer.</font>

561
00:24:14,830 --> 00:24:15,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whatever the situation,</font>

562
00:24:15,480 --> 00:24:16,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you can't lock people up.</font>

563
00:24:16,350 --> 00:24:17,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at them.</font>

564
00:24:17,240 --> 00:24:18,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's so cold.</font>

565
00:24:18,350 --> 00:24:19,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sorry, everyone.</font>

566
00:24:20,200 --> 00:24:22,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Quick, get the tax officers out.</font>

567
00:24:22,240 --> 00:24:22,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, let's go.</font>

568
00:24:23,000 --> 00:24:23,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You must be freezing.</font>

569
00:24:23,640 --> 00:24:24,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, this way.</font>

570
00:24:25,720 --> 00:24:26,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This way.</font>

571
00:24:26,200 --> 00:24:27,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is outrageous.</font>

572
00:24:30,160 --> 00:24:30,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone,</font>

573
00:24:31,160 --> 00:24:33,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm the deputy director
of Fuyuan Police Station,</font>

574
00:24:33,350 --> 00:24:33,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chen Dazhi.</font>

575
00:24:34,310 --> 00:24:35,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've looked into it.</font>

576
00:24:35,550 --> 00:24:36,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's a misunderstanding.</font>

577
00:24:36,590 --> 00:24:37,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's nothing in the safe</font>

578
00:24:37,640 --> 00:24:38,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but cash.</font>

579
00:24:38,830 --> 00:24:39,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And Mr. Zhang,</font>

580
00:24:40,240 --> 00:24:42,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the tax officers acted professionally.</font>

581
00:24:42,640 --> 00:24:43,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They left your belongings alone.</font>

582
00:24:44,240 --> 00:24:47,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You handled this very badly.</font>

583
00:24:47,400 --> 00:24:48,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look how cold they are.</font>

584
00:24:49,030 --> 00:24:49,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If word gets out,</font>

585
00:24:49,830 --> 00:24:50,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it would look terrible.</font>

586
00:24:51,240 --> 00:24:52,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Apologize to them.</font>

587
00:24:55,550 --> 00:24:56,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell them you're sorry.</font>

588
00:25:02,240 --> 00:25:02,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry.</font>

589
00:25:05,550 --> 00:25:06,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone,</font>

590
00:25:06,400 --> 00:25:07,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Zhang has apologized.</font>

591
00:25:07,790 --> 00:25:09,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's leave it at that for now.</font>

592
00:25:10,110 --> 00:25:10,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's been a long day.</font>

593
00:25:11,200 --> 00:25:12,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go home and get some rest.</font>

594
00:25:12,790 --> 00:25:13,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Director Chen, right?</font>

595
00:25:13,920 --> 00:25:15,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You say you've checked the safe,</font>

596
00:25:16,030 --> 00:25:17,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but we need to see for ourselves.</font>

597
00:25:18,790 --> 00:25:20,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Either let us see inside it,</font>

598
00:25:20,480 --> 00:25:21,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or we'll go back</font>

599
00:25:21,350 --> 00:25:22,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and report everything
that happened today.</font>

600
00:25:23,440 --> 00:25:24,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This won't be the end</font>

601
00:25:24,440 --> 00:25:25,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of our investigation.</font>

602
00:25:29,510 --> 00:25:31,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well, if that's your attitude,</font>

603
00:25:31,030 --> 00:25:32,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I take back my apology.</font>

604
00:25:33,110 --> 00:25:34,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look what they've done</font>

605
00:25:34,790 --> 00:25:36,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to my boss's cellar.</font>

606
00:25:36,350 --> 00:25:38,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So while you're still investigating,</font>

607
00:25:38,640 --> 00:25:40,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">before you've established the facts,</font>

608
00:25:41,310 --> 00:25:43,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">our business is supposed
to take the hit?</font>

609
00:25:44,030 --> 00:25:45,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you saying?</font>

610
00:25:45,240 --> 00:25:46,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cooperating with tax inspections</font>

611
00:25:46,830 --> 00:25:48,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is your company's duty.</font>

612
00:25:48,680 --> 00:25:49,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep this up,</font>

613
00:25:49,550 --> 00:25:50,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I'll put you in cuffs.</font>

614
00:25:52,030 --> 00:25:52,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cuff me?</font>

615
00:25:53,270 --> 00:25:53,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go ahead.</font>

616
00:25:54,790 --> 00:25:55,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cuff me. Go on.</font>

617
00:25:56,110 --> 00:25:57,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, cuff me!</font>

618
00:25:58,310 --> 00:25:59,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Comrades,</font>

619
00:25:59,480 --> 00:26:00,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">since he won't cooperate,</font>

620
00:26:00,510 --> 00:26:01,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">mediation isn't possible.</font>

621
00:26:01,920 --> 00:26:02,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll have to</font>

622
00:26:02,640 --> 00:26:04,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">follow standard procedure.</font>

623
00:26:04,070 --> 00:26:05,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come to the station to give statements.</font>

624
00:26:25,270 --> 00:26:26,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao's inside.</font>

625
00:26:29,640 --> 00:26:30,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're here.</font>

626
00:26:35,750 --> 00:26:36,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao.</font>

627
00:26:48,160 --> 00:26:48,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is Haiyang.</font>

628
00:26:49,400 --> 00:26:50,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haiyang.</font>

629
00:26:51,400 --> 00:26:52,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahua, Haiyang,</font>

630
00:26:53,160 --> 00:26:54,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you're brothers now.</font>

631
00:26:55,000 --> 00:26:55,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hi, Huasheng.</font>

632
00:26:55,920 --> 00:26:57,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nice to meet you.</font>

633
00:27:02,200 --> 00:27:04,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let the boys go have some fun.</font>

634
00:27:04,680 --> 00:27:05,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take Haiyang with you.</font>

635
00:27:05,750 --> 00:27:06,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need. I'll stay here.</font>

636
00:27:07,000 --> 00:27:08,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go.</font>

637
00:27:09,240 --> 00:27:10,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stay.</font>

638
00:27:16,510 --> 00:27:17,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sit.</font>

639
00:27:20,640 --> 00:27:24,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Fuyuan Police Station]</font>

640
00:27:27,920 --> 00:27:29,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry about this, everyone.</font>

641
00:27:29,160 --> 00:27:29,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bear with us a little longer.</font>

642
00:27:30,310 --> 00:27:31,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We have to follow procedure.</font>

643
00:27:31,920 --> 00:27:33,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xu, your badge pin's broken.</font>

644
00:27:34,400 --> 00:27:35,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hold it for me.</font>

645
00:27:36,440 --> 00:27:36,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Jia.</font>

646
00:27:37,270 --> 00:27:37,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

647
00:27:37,640 --> 00:27:39,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take them to the office</font>

648
00:27:39,270 --> 00:27:40,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to take statements.</font>

649
00:27:40,350 --> 00:27:40,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

650
00:27:44,440 --> 00:27:44,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Director Chen.</font>

651
00:27:45,790 --> 00:27:46,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How should we handle them?</font>

652
00:27:48,920 --> 00:27:49,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait.</font>

653
00:27:49,550 --> 00:27:50,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Understood.</font>

654
00:28:31,510 --> 00:28:32,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Officer,</font>

655
00:28:32,550 --> 00:28:34,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when will you take our statements?</font>

656
00:28:34,590 --> 00:28:35,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait a bit longer.</font>

657
00:28:35,590 --> 00:28:36,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Director's busy.</font>

658
00:28:40,400 --> 00:28:41,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're hungry?</font>

659
00:29:17,550 --> 00:29:18,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop it.</font>

660
00:29:24,680 --> 00:29:25,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't move!</font>

661
00:29:29,110 --> 00:29:30,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come play with me.</font>

662
00:29:30,680 --> 00:29:31,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's play.</font>

663
00:29:37,590 --> 00:29:38,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't move.</font>

664
00:29:44,680 --> 00:29:46,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Don't move!
- Stay where you are!</font>

665
00:29:46,790 --> 00:29:47,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cuff him.</font>

666
00:29:47,240 --> 00:29:47,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

667
00:29:48,510 --> 00:29:48,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go.</font>

668
00:29:49,880 --> 00:29:51,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Move!
- Go on, move!</font>

669
00:29:54,510 --> 00:29:55,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you looking at? Move it!</font>

670
00:30:00,350 --> 00:30:01,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ping'an, your hand's bleeding.</font>

671
00:30:02,270 --> 00:30:03,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine. Don't worry.</font>

672
00:30:03,550 --> 00:30:04,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Du, give our contact details</font>

673
00:30:05,270 --> 00:30:06,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to everyone here.</font>

674
00:30:06,880 --> 00:30:07,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take him to the car.</font>

675
00:30:07,680 --> 00:30:08,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take him away.</font>

676
00:30:08,680 --> 00:30:09,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Hello.
- Go.</font>

677
00:30:09,510 --> 00:30:10,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you see anyone missing a thumb,</font>

678
00:30:11,000 --> 00:30:12,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">call this number.</font>

679
00:30:12,880 --> 00:30:13,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hand them all out.</font>

680
00:30:13,590 --> 00:30:14,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If anyone's missing a thumb,</font>

681
00:30:14,720 --> 00:30:16,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">contact Officer Yan at this number.</font>

682
00:30:16,960 --> 00:30:18,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Here.
- If you see a man missing a thumb,</font>

683
00:30:18,920 --> 00:30:19,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">be sure to contact us.</font>

684
00:30:19,590 --> 00:30:20,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey,</font>

685
00:30:21,000 --> 00:30:21,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">um...</font>

686
00:30:22,070 --> 00:30:22,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm getting some food.</font>

687
00:30:22,960 --> 00:30:23,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you coming?</font>

688
00:30:23,830 --> 00:30:24,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I already ate.</font>

689
00:30:25,160 --> 00:30:26,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The girls here are gorgeous.</font>

690
00:30:26,160 --> 00:30:27,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me show you a good time.</font>

691
00:30:27,200 --> 00:30:28,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not going.</font>

692
00:30:28,160 --> 00:30:28,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You guys have fun.</font>

693
00:30:29,240 --> 00:30:30,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao gave us some money.</font>

694
00:30:30,200 --> 00:30:31,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He wants you to have some fun.</font>

695
00:30:31,350 --> 00:30:31,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, let's go.</font>

696
00:30:32,000 --> 00:30:33,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, thanks.
I'm getting something to eat.</font>

697
00:30:33,960 --> 00:30:35,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Smart kid.</font>

698
00:30:40,240 --> 00:30:41,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Officer!</font>

699
00:30:41,880 --> 00:30:42,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry!</font>

700
00:30:43,160 --> 00:30:43,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What happened?</font>

701
00:30:43,720 --> 00:30:44,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's probably hungry.</font>

702
00:30:44,830 --> 00:30:46,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She suddenly fainted.</font>

703
00:30:47,310 --> 00:30:49,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss. Miss, wake up.</font>

704
00:30:49,680 --> 00:30:50,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you have anything to eat?</font>

705
00:30:50,920 --> 00:30:52,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where would I get food?</font>

706
00:30:52,160 --> 00:30:53,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you eat, then?</font>

707
00:30:54,160 --> 00:30:54,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well,</font>

708
00:30:55,310 --> 00:30:56,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you stay with her.</font>

709
00:30:56,160 --> 00:30:56,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll get you some food.</font>

710
00:30:57,240 --> 00:30:57,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

711
00:30:58,400 --> 00:30:58,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks.</font>

712
00:31:01,880 --> 00:31:02,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's gone.</font>

713
00:31:15,790 --> 00:31:16,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll keep watch outside.</font>

714
00:31:17,640 --> 00:31:18,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Kid,</font>

715
00:31:19,240 --> 00:31:20,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you assaulted an officer.</font>

716
00:31:20,350 --> 00:31:21,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's three</font>

717
00:31:21,310 --> 00:31:22,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to seven years.</font>

718
00:31:22,110 --> 00:31:23,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know what you've done.</font>

719
00:31:25,400 --> 00:31:26,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know why I wanted to see you?</font>

720
00:31:27,880 --> 00:31:30,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There was a fatal shootout
at that warehouse.</font>

721
00:31:31,070 --> 00:31:32,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know how serious this is.</font>

722
00:31:32,830 --> 00:31:34,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's in your interest to talk.</font>

723
00:31:38,070 --> 00:31:39,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They came by boat from Hong Kong, China.</font>

724
00:31:39,830 --> 00:31:41,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just brought them ashore.</font>

725
00:31:41,750 --> 00:31:43,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know anything else.</font>

726
00:31:43,240 --> 00:31:45,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your relatives run smuggling there.</font>

727
00:31:45,680 --> 00:31:48,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're their man here.
How could you not know?</font>

728
00:31:48,350 --> 00:31:49,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really don't know.</font>

729
00:31:50,750 --> 00:31:53,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell me yourself,
and you get the credit.</font>

730
00:31:53,640 --> 00:31:56,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I have to tell you, you get nothing.</font>

731
00:31:58,350 --> 00:31:59,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who exactly are they?</font>

732
00:31:59,830 --> 00:32:01,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Which gang?</font>

733
00:32:02,640 --> 00:32:03,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Talk!</font>

734
00:32:03,310 --> 00:32:04,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yilian Society,</font>

735
00:32:05,960 --> 00:32:06,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao.</font>

736
00:32:07,680 --> 00:32:08,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao.</font>

737
00:32:11,590 --> 00:32:13,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Were today's arrivals his men, too?</font>

738
00:32:13,510 --> 00:32:13,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

739
00:32:13,960 --> 00:32:14,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How many?</font>

740
00:32:17,960 --> 00:32:18,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nine.</font>

741
00:32:22,720 --> 00:32:23,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come to Fuyuan Police Station.</font>

742
00:32:25,590 --> 00:32:26,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do I get credit for that?</font>

743
00:32:28,160 --> 00:32:28,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, you do.</font>

744
00:32:29,510 --> 00:32:29,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Du,</font>

745
00:32:30,400 --> 00:32:31,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">take him back to the station.</font>

746
00:32:31,160 --> 00:32:31,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait for me to come back.</font>

747
00:32:31,750 --> 00:32:32,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

748
00:32:32,070 --> 00:32:33,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You three are quite something.</font>

749
00:32:34,000 --> 00:32:35,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One of you is an actor,</font>

750
00:32:35,590 --> 00:32:37,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">another's a sprinter.</font>

751
00:32:37,240 --> 00:32:38,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a talented bunch.</font>

752
00:32:38,350 --> 00:32:39,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You kept us waiting all night.</font>

753
00:32:39,680 --> 00:32:41,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her blood sugar dropped from not eating.</font>

754
00:32:41,590 --> 00:32:42,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can't I get her some food?</font>

755
00:32:44,510 --> 00:32:45,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Director Chen.</font>

756
00:32:45,960 --> 00:32:46,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What?</font>

757
00:32:49,270 --> 00:32:49,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's going on?</font>

758
00:32:50,640 --> 00:32:51,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't I tell you?</font>

759
00:32:51,790 --> 00:32:53,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take their statements</font>

760
00:32:53,160 --> 00:32:54,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and let them go home.</font>

761
00:32:54,440 --> 00:32:55,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at the time.</font>

762
00:32:55,070 --> 00:32:55,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're still here.</font>

763
00:32:56,000 --> 00:32:57,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We didn't get any instructions.</font>

764
00:32:57,920 --> 00:32:58,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What instructions?</font>

765
00:32:59,240 --> 00:33:00,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The tax officers were asked to come</font>

766
00:33:00,720 --> 00:33:01,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to explain what happened,</font>

767
00:33:02,070 --> 00:33:02,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">not to be interrogated.</font>

768
00:33:04,920 --> 00:33:05,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry about that.</font>

769
00:33:05,680 --> 00:33:06,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">An urgent case came up.</font>

770
00:33:07,110 --> 00:33:08,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My men were careless.</font>

771
00:33:08,160 --> 00:33:09,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We didn't know he was your friend.</font>

772
00:33:09,310 --> 00:33:09,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Director Chen,</font>

773
00:33:10,000 --> 00:33:11,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you're working late.</font>

774
00:33:11,590 --> 00:33:12,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you. Sorry for the trouble.</font>

775
00:33:14,200 --> 00:33:15,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let the officers go home.</font>

776
00:33:18,200 --> 00:33:19,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Aren't you gonna wait for me?</font>

777
00:33:20,510 --> 00:33:21,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What happened to your hand?</font>

778
00:33:21,440 --> 00:33:22,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's nothing.</font>

779
00:33:22,510 --> 00:33:23,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was working a case.</font>

780
00:33:23,590 --> 00:33:24,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My pager wouldn't stop.</font>

781
00:33:24,960 --> 00:33:27,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not so high and mighty now, Mr. Taxman?</font>

782
00:33:29,510 --> 00:33:30,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Doesn't your hand hurt?</font>

783
00:33:33,030 --> 00:33:33,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where's Aike's staff?</font>

784
00:33:34,110 --> 00:33:36,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They left ages ago. Why would they wait?</font>

785
00:33:39,310 --> 00:33:41,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, let's get something to eat.</font>

786
00:33:41,400 --> 00:33:41,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

787
00:33:42,480 --> 00:33:43,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She doesn't mean that.</font>

788
00:33:43,960 --> 00:33:45,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We have to pick up the bike at Aike.</font>

789
00:33:45,920 --> 00:33:46,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You guys eat first.</font>

790
00:33:46,550 --> 00:33:47,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

791
00:33:48,000 --> 00:33:48,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

792
00:33:48,640 --> 00:33:50,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll... I'll buy you dinner.</font>

793
00:33:50,070 --> 00:33:50,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All right, then.</font>

794
00:33:51,070 --> 00:33:52,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll head off first.</font>

795
00:33:52,270 --> 00:33:53,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See you around.</font>

796
00:33:56,270 --> 00:33:57,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You really went all out.</font>

797
00:33:57,400 --> 00:33:58,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seriously though,</font>

798
00:33:59,480 --> 00:34:00,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">something's wrong at Aike.</font>

799
00:34:02,510 --> 00:34:04,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And with that director, too.</font>

800
00:34:05,480 --> 00:34:06,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll settle this score later.</font>

801
00:34:07,920 --> 00:34:09,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go to your place
for my mom's cooking.</font>

802
00:34:10,190 --> 00:34:11,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your mom? She's my mom.</font>

803
00:34:11,960 --> 00:34:13,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your mom is my mom.</font>

804
00:34:13,360 --> 00:34:14,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you no shame?</font>

805
00:34:21,230 --> 00:34:22,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My hand's weak. Help me shift.</font>

806
00:34:23,670 --> 00:34:24,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why not say so earlier?</font>

807
00:34:24,920 --> 00:34:25,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me drive, then.</font>

808
00:34:28,670 --> 00:34:29,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Change gear.</font>

809
00:34:30,590 --> 00:34:32,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We make a good team.</font>

810
00:34:46,030 --> 00:34:46,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hungry?</font>

811
00:34:47,070 --> 00:34:49,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want two orders
of Tao's "Guaranteed Fall."</font>

812
00:34:49,670 --> 00:34:51,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's called "Guaranteed Full."</font>

813
00:34:51,030 --> 00:34:52,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right. "Guaranteed Full."</font>

814
00:34:53,230 --> 00:34:54,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'll eat when we get there.</font>

815
00:34:55,510 --> 00:34:56,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Tao!
- Tao!</font>

816
00:34:58,550 --> 00:34:59,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tao!</font>

817
00:35:00,630 --> 00:35:01,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your son's home!</font>

818
00:35:25,500 --> 00:35:31,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In endless rain,
I drink to half a lifetime of dreams♪</font>

819
00:35:32,730 --> 00:35:36,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The bitter wind strikes,
but I stand my ground♪</font>

820
00:35:36,840 --> 00:35:38,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Does it hurt?</font>

821
00:35:38,110 --> 00:35:38,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

822
00:35:39,000 --> 00:35:40,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you know what "careful" means?</font>

823
00:35:40,400 --> 00:35:41,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you?</font>

824
00:35:41,630 --> 00:35:43,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know, Mom.</font>

825
00:35:43,150 --> 00:35:44,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was being careful.</font>

826
00:35:44,280 --> 00:35:45,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's just a little cut.</font>

827
00:35:45,800 --> 00:35:46,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's nothing.</font>

828
00:35:46,360 --> 00:35:47,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nonsense.</font>

829
00:35:48,280 --> 00:35:49,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ignore him. Come on, Xu.</font>

830
00:35:50,190 --> 00:35:51,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help yourself.</font>

831
00:35:52,230 --> 00:35:52,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Eat up.</font>

832
00:35:54,440 --> 00:35:55,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Slow down.</font>

833
00:35:55,400 --> 00:35:57,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can you enjoy eating so much?</font>

834
00:35:57,110 --> 00:35:58,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm so jealous.</font>

835
00:35:58,590 --> 00:36:00,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course. My cooking's delicious.</font>

836
00:36:00,550 --> 00:36:02,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, I envy you, too.</font>

837
00:36:03,400 --> 00:36:04,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you envy me for?</font>

838
00:36:04,440 --> 00:36:06,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tao's cooking tastes like home.</font>

839
00:36:07,440 --> 00:36:08,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just seeing her makes me hungry.</font>

840
00:36:08,960 --> 00:36:10,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once I start eating, I never feel full.</font>

841
00:36:11,880 --> 00:36:12,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tao,</font>

842
00:36:13,230 --> 00:36:14,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ping'an's really good.</font>

843
00:36:14,550 --> 00:36:16,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've risked our lives together.</font>

844
00:36:16,480 --> 00:36:17,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's a boss already.</font>

845
00:36:18,230 --> 00:36:20,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have to beg him to bail me out.</font>

846
00:36:20,400 --> 00:36:23,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He gets it all from his mother.</font>

847
00:36:23,360 --> 00:36:24,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From you, of course.</font>

848
00:36:25,480 --> 00:36:25,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">By the way,</font>

849
00:36:26,880 --> 00:36:28,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there's been some progress</font>

850
00:36:28,760 --> 00:36:29,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in your master's stabbing case.</font>

851
00:36:30,150 --> 00:36:30,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you caught him?</font>

852
00:36:31,000 --> 00:36:31,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not yet.</font>

853
00:36:32,000 --> 00:36:33,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But we have some leads.</font>

854
00:36:33,280 --> 00:36:34,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You need to be careful, too.</font>

855
00:36:35,000 --> 00:36:36,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You need to be careful, too.</font>

856
00:36:36,070 --> 00:36:37,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Both of you, be careful.</font>

857
00:36:37,590 --> 00:36:38,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, okay.</font>

858
00:36:38,510 --> 00:36:40,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From tomorrow, call me "Careful Yan."</font>

859
00:36:40,590 --> 00:36:42,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There you go again.</font>

860
00:36:42,030 --> 00:36:42,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't just eat meat.</font>

861
00:36:42,960 --> 00:36:44,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have some vegetables.</font>

862
00:36:44,150 --> 00:36:44,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give him some more.</font>

863
00:36:44,920 --> 00:36:45,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am eating.</font>

864
00:36:45,720 --> 00:36:52,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A longing I can't forget,
like the morning light♪</font>

865
00:36:52,360 --> 00:36:53,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The way you eat</font>

866
00:36:54,710 --> 00:36:55,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">reminds me of someone.</font>

867
00:36:57,000 --> 00:36:58,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhou Haiyang.</font>

868
00:36:59,280 --> 00:37:00,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I knew you'd say that.</font>

869
00:37:01,280 --> 00:37:02,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We haven't seen him in a long time.</font>

870
00:37:02,880 --> 00:37:04,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, now that you mention him,</font>

871
00:37:05,230 --> 00:37:06,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I still feel bad about him.</font>

872
00:37:07,280 --> 00:37:08,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haiyang</font>

873
00:37:08,190 --> 00:37:10,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">helped Ping'an and me with the case.</font>

874
00:37:10,480 --> 00:37:12,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We tried to get him credit
for helping us.</font>

875
00:37:13,190 --> 00:37:14,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But it didn't work out.</font>

876
00:37:14,800 --> 00:37:15,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me stop you there.</font>

877
00:37:16,070 --> 00:37:18,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wouldn't say we failed.</font>

878
00:37:19,110 --> 00:37:20,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're just a low-ranking tax officer,</font>

879
00:37:20,670 --> 00:37:21,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I'm just a low-ranking cop.</font>

880
00:37:22,320 --> 00:37:23,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How much influence do we have?</font>

881
00:37:24,190 --> 00:37:25,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We did our best.</font>

882
00:37:25,510 --> 00:37:26,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're right.</font>

883
00:37:27,280 --> 00:37:30,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As his friends, you did all you could.</font>

884
00:37:31,360 --> 00:37:31,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

885
00:37:32,230 --> 00:37:34,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's not dwell on that over dinner.</font>

886
00:37:34,030 --> 00:37:35,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, eat up.</font>

887
00:37:35,030 --> 00:37:35,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Eat.</font>

888
00:37:35,480 --> 00:37:36,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

889
00:37:36,630 --> 00:37:38,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Eat chicken feet to mend your claw.</font>

890
00:37:39,000 --> 00:37:39,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One claw for another.</font>

891
00:37:40,000 --> 00:37:41,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My claw will be good as new tomorrow.</font>

892
00:37:42,820 --> 00:37:46,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still have you to keep me safe♪</font>

